<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Kids: Levers" id="0016d64d" height="411" width="574" hasaudio="0" hascredits="1" lang="E" basecontroltype="SlideShowControl" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="Kids1" skinlib="kids1"><slides><slide type="standard" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="1" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Una palanca es una barra rígida que tiene tres partes. El brazo resistente es la parte de la palanca que levanta un objeto. El brazo motor es la parte de la palanca que tú elevas o bajas. La palanca se balancea sobre un punto de apoyo o “fulcro”.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Partes de una palanca&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0016d64d_slide1.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="78" y="237"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>-55</y></point></points><origin><x>74</x><y>255</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Brazo resistente&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Brazo&lt;br&gt;resistente&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="74" y="238" w="77" h="33"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="220" y="286"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>-78</y></point></points><origin><x>216</x><y>304</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Fulcro o punto de apoyo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Fulcro o&lt;br&gt;punto de apoyo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="216" y="287" w="114" h="33"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="291" y="239"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>-39</y></point></points><origin><x>342</x><y>257</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Brazo motor&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Brazo&lt;br&gt;motor&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="287" y="240" w="55" h="33"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Partes de una palanca&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="2" sequence="2"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Con una palanca puedes levantar un objeto muy pesado, desplazando para ello la posición de su punto de apoyo o fulcro. Si acercas el punto de apoyo al objeto pesado, te resulta más fácil mover el brazo motor para levantar el objeto.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Para levantar objetos pesados&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0016d64d_slide2.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="57" y="246"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>-48</y></point></points><origin><x>53</x><y>264</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Brazo resistente&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>2</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Brazo&lt;br&gt;resistente&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="53" y="247" w="77" h="33"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="160" y="258"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>-52</y></point></points><origin><x>156</x><y>276</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Fulcro o punto de apoyo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>2</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Fulcro o&lt;br&gt;punto de apoyo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="156" y="259" w="114" h="33"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="259" y="240"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>-37</y></point></points><origin><x>348</x><y>250</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Brazo motor&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>2</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Brazo motor&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="255" y="241" w="93" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Para levantar objetos pesados&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="3" sequence="3"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Te sorprendería saber cuántas máquinas utilizan palancas. Una bomba de extracción de agua actúa como una palanca para sacar el agua de un pozo. Las afiladas hojas de unas tijeras actúan como palancas para cortar fácilmente telas, papel u otros objetos. Cuando pulsas una tecla de un piano, una palanca hace que un martillo golpee una cuerda, produciendo un sonido.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Algunas palancas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0016d64d_Slide3.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="5" y="0"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Bomba de extracción de agua&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Bomba de extracción de agua&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="1" y="1" w="208" h="17"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="286" y="0"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Tijeras&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Tijeras&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="282" y="1" w="56" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="297" y="148"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Piano&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Piano&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="293" y="149" w="47" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>25a4072e, 1b827a0f, 29d29344</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Algunas palancas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide></slides><slideshowcontrol bottombarbgcolorid="4" textdividerbarcolorid="4" creditsbuttonstyleid="3" resetbuttonstyleid="4" navbuttonstyleid="1" numbermenuitems="0" showpop="1" autoadvance="0" shownavarrows="1" bottombarheight="31"><audiocontrollerstyle bgcolorid="5" progresscolorid="4" guttercolorid="5" graphiccolorid="3" outlinecolorid="6" buttonstyleid="1"/><popmenustyl